<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta has destroyed bridges in Arakan and moved west of the Sittaung River while planning a 108‑kilometre fence on the Bangladesh border, and an airstrike hit a displacement camp in Rakhine. In Sagaing, junta forces killed 11 people as Starlink outages isolated communities and health-care facilities continued to be attacked in October 2026. Gold revenues now fund resistance groups and Myanmar-linked arsenic pollution is driving a clean-water scramble in Thailand. The UN top court will soon rule on the Rohingya genocide case, a verdict that refugees are pinning their hopes on, and 2,332 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/18/world/asia/myanmar-rohingya-muslim-genocide-world-court.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/15/myanmar-rohingya-genocide-icj&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOWnVMNkg1c3NVbXM3WFphOHVCTlJhVENsYXZWbC1rSTY3SDdROGlFV1JPQVAtZ3o4QzQyT3BUOEdQaTAwbUQ0b3RCMThRcHkyZWk2aF9NVUd1XzdsUmRibk55UU0zYXZ5Z3dIc2ZteEJxNl9SaFppSTZFeExaZW42MWo2M011QXpUU2hhaElHNTlPNVl0cDVZODkxazZwOGoxdDduZEJPMEdlM1JSNGEtZzF3?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxORkJhM3ZablppcWlEOGRnNVZ1cTY2a00yRVFrUkYzd1RwSFdjYnZvdU90NlFLMFpJUGRrb1AzOEk1bXl6MUd0enF6SU8zYXNnTmhmVFBzUHY0UUVNQ3kwVG1xX2hPVWg1RDcyLWV2eFFRNnN5SXBnQzhxb2dKaWZCZ3MtZHlROTRFRU5zbW9MNW1hS3VVRWFNdGZKYUd1UVYzVnFfN3dPRW1DeHU2OXVrbW1XNTdhZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/19/icj-to-rule-on-rohingya-genocide-case-against-myanmar?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c5m2l90ez144o